  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MVS/BH_NU_HEADER.png\" alt=\"横幅\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D8LKA5N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fS5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/869218732650688543?color=3e72b3&amp;label=DISCORD&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-projects-3e72b3?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge 项目\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFinnDog_123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-projects-3e72b3?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 项目\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fvoyager-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/c110cc09347a4f9f9de6c974f2fa35d8.png\" alt=\"查看结构\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MVS/BH_NU_BANNER1.png\" alt=\"概览\"></p><p>该模组支持 Forge、Fabric、NeoForge 和 Quilt！也可仅安装在服务器端。Forge 支持在 1.20.4 版本后停止。</p><h3>关于</h3><p>Moogs Voyager Structures 通过动态且引人入胜的新结构，彻底改变了你的《我的世界》体验。这些结构使用原版方块和实体精心打造，无缝融入游戏，提供激动人心的战利品、具有挑战性的敌人和友好的村民。兼容任何整合包，本模组在保持经典《我的世界》风格的同时，丰富你的世界。与 Moogs Voyager Structures 一同探索充满冒险和发现的世界吧！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fvoyager-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/f8fe835413394a76b10a678afefea30f.png\" alt=\"以3D形式浏览每个结构\"></a></p><h3>配置包</h3><p>模组的每个方面均可通过数据包进行自定义。包含完整说明的模板可在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mvs-moogs-voyager-structure-config-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>找到。</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MVS/BH_NU_BANNER2.png\" alt=\"功能\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/epC7vBE.png\" alt=\"拼贴图\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MVS/BH_NU_BANNER4.png\" alt=\"展示\"></p><h3>视频</h3><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/C6Mzy-1a7Ys\" width=\"650\" height=\"364\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/z0HMHeHAlZ4?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8e1M7q9xczE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/umTiIV1mpJg?t=21s?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/twKJIl2pZpI?t=49s?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/R0MbDUuVNHU?t=420s?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3>整合包</h3><p>查看所有整合包请<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252ffinder%253fincluded_mods%253d37802\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>。</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MVS/BH_NU_BANNER3.png\" alt=\"横幅\"> 获得回复最快最好的方式是加入我们的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/S5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a>。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmoogsmods%253fr%253dcfmvs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MVS/BH_NU_PROMO.png\" alt=\"BH赞助商\"></a></p>",
